---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Real Estate Advisory Services | Deccan Realtors"
  description="Explore Deccan Realtors' 6 core advisory capabilities: Land acquisition, luxury plots, legal due diligence, commercial assets, and registry handover."
>
  <div class="bg-brand-950 text-white py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-brand-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-accent-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Our Capabilities</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-display tracking-tight">Institutional-Grade Advisory Services</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2 max-w-2xl">
        End-to-end guidance designed to protect your capital and maximize long-term asset value.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <div class="springfield-card p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-900 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-bold text-xl">
          🔍
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-900 mb-3">Exhaustive Legal Due Diligence</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Full 30-year title searches, revenue record verification, 7/12 extract audits, RERA compliance validation, and encumbrance certificate verification before any client capital is deployed.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="springfield-card p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-900 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-bold text-xl">
          📈
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-900 mb-3">Micro-Market Growth Analysis</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Identification of infrastructure triggers, ring road alignments, metro extensions, and industrial corridors to position clients ahead of major capital appreciation cycles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="springfield-card p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-900 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-bold text-xl">
          🏘️
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-900 mb-3">Residential Plots & Townships</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Curated access to approved gated layouts and residential plots along Wardha Road, outer corridors, and prime zones with clear demarcation and development infrastructure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="springfield-card p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-900 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-bold text-xl">
          🏢
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-900 mb-3">Commercial & Pre-Leased Assets</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          High-yield retail spaces, corporate office suites, and pre-leased assets structured to generate immediate cash flow and capital safety for high-net-worth investors.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="springfield-card p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-900 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-bold text-xl">
          🌍
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-900 mb-3">NRI & Cross-Border Desk</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Remote power-of-attorney execution, digital due diligence dossiers, repatriable fund advisory, and trusted local representation for NRIs across the globe.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="springfield-card p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-900 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-bold text-xl">
          📜
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-900 mb-3">Transaction Handover & Registry</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Seamless support through sub-registrar office registration, stamp duty optimization, municipal mutation (namantaran), and possession demarcation.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 bg-brand-900 text-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-display mb-4">Looking for Bespoke Property Advisory?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
        Speak with our principal advisory desk to evaluate your investment criteria and access verified off-market opportunities.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-gold px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-black inline-block">
        Schedule Private Session
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
